  "description": "The emotion of fear is expressed through the text overlay claiming that 'leaders want innocent people to give up their guns and become even more defenseless,' which implies vulnerability and danger. This fear is reinforced by the visual of a gun on the Constitution, suggesting that losing gun rights equates to losing personal safety, and the mention of 'terrorist attacks innocent people with guns' evokes anxiety about external threats.",
